WEBVTT

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:13.590
Shaka has opened his eyes!

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.370
Oh, no! Just look at the time!

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:19.580
<i>My name is Kanamori Hakata.</i>

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:21.730
<i>I'm in my second year at Ebisugawa High,</i>

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:23.290
<i>and a member of the Astronomy Club.</i>

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:25.250
I'm going to be late!

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:27.470
<i>I have a feeling that a comment's</i>

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:29.150
<i>about to fly by on the screen that we</i>

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:31.860
<i>included such a cliché "being 
late to school" scene...</i>

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:35.680
<i>Crap, I should have had 
bread in my mouth.</i>

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:37.800
<i>Then I could run into someone...</i>

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:40.050
But I'm really just a normal girl

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:44.050
that loves those types of 
things in her doujinshi. Tee-hee.

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:45.230
Huh?

00:00:46.570 --> 00:00:47.560
Neko-sensei?!

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:49.680
Are you okay?

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:54.110
Hm? Someone put band-aids on you?

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:57.660
You want me to take them off?

00:00:57.900 --> 00:00:59.100
Not a problem.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:00:59.910
Just give me a second.

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:04.620
W-Wait... I know what this is.

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:07.210
This situation...

00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:08.710
This is exactly like what happened

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:10.250
<i>Now transform into Bishoujo Soldier!</i>

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:10.250
in the first episode 
of "Bishoujo Soldier."

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:14.670
M-Maybe if I remove these band-aids,

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:16.750
and the mark of the crescent 
moon is hidden underneath...

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:20.530
I can be a Bishoujo Soldier...

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:25.360
Terry, where are you?

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:27.930
Terry?! Where did you go?

00:01:27.930 --> 00:01:30.900
Oh, Terry! Terry!

00:01:32.350 --> 00:01:34.440
I'm gonna be late.

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:36.110
<b>Crybaby Hakata's Transformation of Splendor</b>

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.990
<b>Agonizing 
Astronomy Club</b>

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:39.990
Hello, everybody!

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:44.990
Huh? Noya-san?

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:48.490
Why are you wearing that?

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:50.490
Todayama made me...

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:52.070
She said it was fine.

00:03:52.070 --> 00:03:54.510
But why a reindeer at this time of year?

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:55.250
What are you...

00:03:57.820 --> 00:03:58.840
Noya, the curtain.

00:03:58.840 --> 00:03:59.990
R-Right.

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:00.320
Stop!

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:04.610
<b>Pure of Intent</b>

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:02.900
Yeah, that's more like it.

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:04.970
You have to have a Santa 
if you have reindeer.

00:04:06.230 --> 00:04:08.800
Jingle bells! Jingle bells!

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:11.520
I have no clue what's going on!

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.560
I don't think Santa's supposed 
to show so much skin.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:16.150
I used Kanamori's cosplay outfits to 
try to put together something nice.

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:18.650
Yeah, but why Santa 
at this time of year?

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:20.980
That's because I'm trying 
to get Santa to come here.

00:04:20.980 --> 00:04:22.520
Like this!

00:04:24.050 --> 00:04:26.030
You're trying to get Santa to come 
here like some sort of old perv.

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:28.870
Why are you trying to 
get Santa to come here?

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:30.480
Because I want something.

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:32.790
That's why you did this?!

00:04:33.090 --> 00:04:35.310
Santa is a servant on a 
mission from God, you know?!

00:04:35.310 --> 00:04:36.670
What season it is has 
nothing to do with it!

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:40.340
He will come because I 
need him here and now!

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:42.970
That's what makes Santa, Santa!

00:04:44.070 --> 00:04:45.510
Kanamori...

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:49.640
Please, I really need to see Santa...

00:04:50.030 --> 00:04:51.570
So help me do this.

00:04:51.570 --> 00:04:52.610
I can't...

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:54.520
I have a feeling that only 
bad can come from this.

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:55.950
Thank you!

00:04:55.950 --> 00:04:57.830
I thought you'd say that.

00:04:57.830 --> 00:04:58.270
Huh?

00:04:58.270 --> 00:05:00.350
Now let's get going!

00:05:00.350 --> 00:05:02.280
What? Dressed like this?

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.570
If we parade you around the 
school dressed like this,

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:06.410
we might get more members for our club.

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:09.780
Our club needs more people, supposedly.

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:11.740
No!

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:13.500
Just what type of pervs does 
she want to attract, anyway?

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:13.500
I don't want to do this!

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:15.040
<b>Student Council</b>

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:15.040
You're getting shut down.

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:18.040
I don't care if you got 
one more member, or not.

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:21.040
What's the problem?

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:22.590
The Astronomy Club hasn't

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:24.920
done any real club activities lately.

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:27.590
We're receiving complaints here.

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:29.830
Complaints...?

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:32.730
"Student Council President,

00:05:32.730 --> 00:05:35.930
The Astronomy Club sucks. 
You totally should get rid of it."

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:37.940
Look at this one. 
Don't forget about this one.

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:39.900
We're getting so many complaints!

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:43.190
The handwriting looks the 
same on all of them.

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:45.520
I-I didn't write them, okay?!

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:50.360
L-Look at the signature here—

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:48.450
Iseda Yuka

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:49.070
Iseda Yuka

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:53.080
I accidentally wrote my name on them!

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:59.210
A-Anyway, the Astronomy 
Club hasn't anything

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:01.000
to do with astronomy anymore.

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:02.840
When I was there, it was...

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:12.390
I understand what you're trying to say.

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:14.870
But the Astronomy Club does 
have activities that—

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:17.510
Hey! Don't run away, Kanamori!

00:06:17.510 --> 00:06:18.980
Stop!

00:06:17.510 --> 00:06:19.280
You're the showgirl for our club!

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:23.060
Stop! Please just stop!

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:20.670
So take off more of your clothes!

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:23.140
More off, now!

00:06:23.060 --> 00:06:25.190
Forgive me!

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:25.190
Yeah. Getting shut down.

00:06:25.630 --> 00:06:26.940
My, my.

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:29.590
Astronomy Club, here!

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:31.370
We're looking for new members!

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:32.950
We're the Astronomy Club!

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:35.520
Looking for new members!

00:06:36.320 --> 00:06:38.000
I can't take this anymore! I'm leaving!

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:40.660
I'm going back to our clubroom!

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:42.000
There's nothing to worry about.

00:06:42.260 --> 00:06:44.820
You're Santa right now.

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:45.800
You're not Kanamori,

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:47.260
so there's no reason to feel 
embarrassed at all, you know?

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:48.890
Liar...

00:06:48.890 --> 00:06:52.260
I think it's obvious 
everyone knows it's me...

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:54.510
Oh, guys from our class just arrived.

00:06:58.140 --> 00:06:59.450
Oh, thanks.

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:00.480
No problem.

00:07:01.800 --> 00:07:03.160
I can't do this anymore.

00:07:03.160 --> 00:07:07.520
I can't let the guys from class 
see me dressed up like a slut.

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:10.900
No!

00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:14.700
U-Um...

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:15.880
What is it?

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:19.280
Why is the Astronomy Club's 
room in the basement?

00:07:19.280 --> 00:07:20.870
You can't see the sky from here.

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:22.890
No clue...

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:25.540
None of them seem like

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:27.570
they really care about the stars at all.

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:30.040
Especially Kanamori-senpai, you know?

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:31.560
Well, they have a pun in the name:

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:34.510
<b>Agonizing 
Astronomy Club</b>

00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:33.200
it's said Astronomy Club, but it 
basically means the agonizing astronomy club.

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:34.830
We're back!

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:35.970
How'd it go?

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:38.270
I think we did a pretty 
good job at advertising.

00:07:39.230 --> 00:07:40.340
You're terrible.

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:44.120
Everyone saw me dressed like this.

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:48.500
I bet everyone in class 
thinks I'm a perv....

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:56.730
Tomorrow, I'll be prey for all of 
those voracious monsters out there.

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:01.350
<i>The hot-blooded wolves 
will come after me,</i>

00:08:01.350 --> 00:08:05.230
<i>and I'll get eaten whole by 
the cool-looking wolves.</i>

00:08:05.230 --> 00:08:09.080
<i>A showdown between a bunch of 
tops, and a single bottom.</i>

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:12.200
<i>That'd be a pretty good 
story in a doujinshi.</i>

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:18.460
Th-That can't happen!

00:08:17.740 --> 00:08:20.030
Kanamori's in her "imagination 
running wild" mode.

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:25.020
I can't stay in this club anymore!

00:08:25.340 --> 00:08:28.440
Give me back my innocence!

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:30.580
I can't stand this anymore!

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:32.940
I just can't... I can't... 
I really can't!

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:35.230
Th-That wasn't good, was it?

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:37.570
<b>The Next Day</b>

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:42.260
Why are you wearing that?

00:08:42.260 --> 00:08:45.010
I don't know when the starving 
wolves will try to attack me,

00:08:45.010 --> 00:08:47.790
after having seen me in 
my sexy Santa outfit.

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:49.500
I have to hide.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:50.870
I won't go to club!

00:08:55.950 --> 00:08:58.490
I guess her imagination's 
still running wild, huh?

00:09:02.110 --> 00:09:04.420
I wonder if Santa's coming.

00:09:04.420 --> 00:09:05.630
You're still going on about that?

00:09:05.630 --> 00:09:08.350
There's something I want.

00:09:08.350 --> 00:09:10.360
What do you want?

00:09:11.180 --> 00:09:13.350
None of your business.

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:16.780
All right. We're changing plans.

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:17.550
<b>Pure of Intent</b>

00:09:20.380 --> 00:09:22.410
This isn't going to win any fans.

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:23.740
That's not even sexy.

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:25.110
She's not resisting, either.

00:09:25.110 --> 00:09:27.290
S-Sorry...

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:29.330
U-Um...

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:30.500
What is it, Noya?

00:09:30.810 --> 00:09:33.200
What's wrong with Kanamori-senpai?

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:34.120
She's got a problem.

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:37.760
It turns out she's... an exhibitionist!

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:38.930
What?!

00:09:39.310 --> 00:09:41.100
Ever since she paraded herself around

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:42.930
the school yesterday in that sexy outfit,

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:44.930
a fire has been lit deep within her...

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:48.190
And now she's ignoring this club, 
and is now delving into streaking.

00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:57.620
G-Gaze upon me.

00:09:57.620 --> 00:09:59.860
Eventually, she'll get 
taken in by the police,

00:09:59.860 --> 00:10:02.490
and they'll require someone to 
take legal custody over her...

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:05.460
I'll go and pick her 
up when that happens.

00:10:08.760 --> 00:10:10.080
Vice President?

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:13.180
The darker the night, 
the brighter the stars shine.

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:13.840
Huh?

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:17.820
We mustn't forget about 
Hokule'a, Todayama-san.

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:38.110
I hate stupid things!

00:10:39.540 --> 00:10:41.110
Damn it all!

00:11:11.390 --> 00:11:13.100
Oh, Oomori-sensei!

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:16.670
This is Oomori-sensei.

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:18.740
Oomori-neko-sensei.

00:11:19.060 --> 00:11:21.240
I'm not a teacher.

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:23.610
I was dumped by the guy I like,

00:11:23.610 --> 00:11:26.370
so on the way back home, I bought some 
low-malt beer at a 100 yen store,

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:28.450
and drank it all alone in my room..

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:31.410
I'm just a woman, Oomori Shouko.

00:11:31.410 --> 00:11:32.330
Huh?

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:35.420
I'm going to vanish!

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:37.420
What was that about?

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:49.330
One... Two...

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:51.060
Neko-sensei...

00:11:51.380 --> 00:11:53.470
I guess I should head back about now.

00:12:02.680 --> 00:12:04.600
<i>E-Everyone's looking at me...</i>

00:12:06.630 --> 00:12:07.740
Sensei!

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:14.370
You have to help, Kanamori-senpai!

00:12:15.070 --> 00:12:17.380
The Astronomy Club is in jeopardy!

00:12:17.640 --> 00:12:19.460
Hurry up.

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:20.760
What?!

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:25.530
T-Todayama...

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:26.510
What are you doing?

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:29.390
I'm not Todayama...

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:34.500
I'm a bad guy that just 
looks like Todayama!

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:35.850
Help me.

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:36.860
Hakata-chan.

00:12:37.600 --> 00:12:38.890
The cat talked!

00:12:38.890 --> 00:12:41.770
Hurry up and transform, 
and take out this enemy.

00:12:41.770 --> 00:12:44.030
You're the chosen warrior.

00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:47.030
I knew it...

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:50.220
She still acts like a kid, 
so she'll play along without asking.

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:51.790
We've pushed her buttons now.

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:54.000
I've been waiting for this moment.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:57.340
Anything else I need to know, 
this bible will tell me!

00:12:57.340 --> 00:12:59.400
Moon Something-or-other Power!

00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:01.270
Image up!

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:32.620
Tailor Moon.

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:42.920
See? I told you it'd be simple to get

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:45.090
Kanamori to come back to the club.

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:47.720
If you're prepared, 
you won't run into any trouble,

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:49.910
even if your ion thrusters stop working.

00:13:50.310 --> 00:13:51.970
I thought this might happen,

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:54.600
so I'm glad I had this doujinshi.

00:13:54.950 --> 00:13:58.310
The beautiful cosplay warrior 
of love and courage:

00:14:02.770 --> 00:14:04.610
Tailor Moon!

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:09.250
In the name of the moon, 
I will dress you!

00:14:10.430 --> 00:14:13.040
What's that about? Tailor...

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:15.480
It's the made-to-order cosplay shop that

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:17.500
appears in the legendary doujinshi.

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:32.300
<i>If you go there, you can find 
any cosplay you want.</i>

00:14:23.370 --> 00:14:25.140
It looks like she's really into it.

00:14:25.140 --> 00:14:27.110
You put together a situation,

00:14:27.110 --> 00:14:30.050
and her body just acts to it on its own.

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:32.240
That's the fate of a fujoshi.

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:33.520
Hey, over there!

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:34.520
You're supposed to be the bad guy,

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:35.770
so why are you two 
whispering over there?

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:37.170
Shut up, Kanamori!

00:14:37.170 --> 00:14:38.020
What was that?

00:14:38.250 --> 00:14:42.400
Moon Measure Action!

00:14:47.270 --> 00:14:48.330
She dodged it!

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:51.320
You're just a Kanamori! Take this!

00:14:52.460 --> 00:14:54.330
I thought this might happen!

00:14:55.270 --> 00:14:58.370
Tailor Moon: Scissors!

00:15:00.230 --> 00:15:01.900
I can't believe all of this

00:15:01.900 --> 00:15:04.020
is happening to the cosplay 
warrior of justice!

00:15:04.020 --> 00:15:06.200
Noya-san'll have to transform, too.

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:07.010
What?

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:10.260
I can turn everyone into 
beautiful cosplay girls,

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:13.430
for I am the legendary 
tailor: Tailor Moon!

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:15.910
My special power is splashing 
out pointless bickering,

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:17.520
for I am Tailor Marketing!

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:19.060
In the name of Mercury,

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:19.060
<b>Tailor Marketing</b>

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:20.620
I am pleased to meet your acquaintance.

00:15:21.180 --> 00:15:23.330
I don't even know what's 
going on anymore.

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:24.560
Here's my chance!

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:26.070
You fell for it!

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:27.940
Japanese people always take

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:30.350
a business card when 
they're handed one...

00:15:30.350 --> 00:15:31.530
I name this technique the

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:33.950
"Employee Business Card 
Exchange Illusion!"

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:36.260
All right! Now that all 
five of us are together

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:37.440
we can use our finishing move.

00:15:37.440 --> 00:15:38.450
Huh? Five of us?

00:15:40.780 --> 00:15:42.600
Tailor Reception Desk.

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:47.970
Tailor Accounting.

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:53.730
Tailor Sales!

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:56.470
When did you...

00:15:56.470 --> 00:15:58.310
Kanamori-san dressed me up.

00:15:58.730 --> 00:16:01.770
All right! Here we go, the five of us!

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:04.650
Cosplay warriors of love and courage:

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:06.120
Beautiful Transformation!

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:07.900
Tailor...

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:15.530
Marketing! Accounting! 
Reception Desk! Sales!

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:17.980
My employees!

00:16:17.980 --> 00:16:19.290
We're your employees?

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:22.660
Hang in there, Tailor Accounting!

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:24.910
Please, don't die!

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:25.860
Kanamori.

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:28.120
I'm sorry.

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:30.170
It looks like I'm not going to make it.

00:16:30.910 --> 00:16:32.090
Hiromatsu...

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:35.720
We've had so much fun together 
in the Astronomy Club.

00:16:43.700 --> 00:16:45.980
All of this started...

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:49.660
the day you joined our club.

00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:52.280
The Forbidden Sanctuary

00:16:55.630 --> 00:16:56.670
<i>What should I do...</i>

00:16:56.670 --> 00:16:58.510
<i>I just started school here...</i>

00:16:58.510 --> 00:17:00.660
<i>and now everyone's going 
to think I'm weird.</i>

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:03.060
<i>What if I can't make friends...</i>

00:17:03.630 --> 00:17:06.080
<i>Your name's Kanamori, right?</i>

00:17:09.650 --> 00:17:12.050
<i>Do you have time after school today?</i>

00:17:13.870 --> 00:17:15.230
<i>I-I do.</i>

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:35.780
That's when you opened the 
door to the Astronomy Club.

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:38.910
Why are you talking about...

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:40.760
That's a good story.

00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:43.130
Actually, I wanted to 
join the Astronomy Club

00:17:43.130 --> 00:17:45.750
but there weren't enough members,

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:48.520
so I targeted the weakest 
looking girl in my class.

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:52.450
Kanamori, come back to the club.

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:56.270
This is the only place 
you can be yoursel...

00:17:57.900 --> 00:17:59.280
Hiromatsu!

00:17:59.280 --> 00:18:00.590
An epic death.

00:18:00.590 --> 00:18:01.660
Bleh.

00:18:02.280 --> 00:18:04.430
Hiromatsu!

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:11.490
Everyone died because of me...

00:18:11.490 --> 00:18:13.240
We're not dead...

00:18:13.240 --> 00:18:16.320
I'll fight for everyone!

00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:21.040
Kanamori Princess! Make up!

00:18:22.890 --> 00:18:25.150
Everyone's gone exactly 
as Todayama said.

00:18:25.150 --> 00:18:27.960
Uh... We're supposed to start 
the music here, right?

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:50.330
<i>Where are you? Come and pick me up,</i>

00:18:50.330 --> 00:18:53.460
<i>my prince on a white horse.</i>

00:18:54.300 --> 00:19:00.420
<i>I'm a princess — imagination is culture.</i>

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:07.680
<i>You can find me by my 
small panda hairpiece.</i>

00:19:08.680 --> 00:19:15.110
<i>Preferably, I'd pick a beautiful, 
hot guy as my default.</i>

00:19:15.980 --> 00:19:20.240
I'll end the entire Astronomy 
Club with these hands,

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:21.880
along with Todayama!

00:19:21.880 --> 00:19:23.640
Shut up! You're just a Kanamori!

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:25.650
Tailor Moon!

00:19:25.650 --> 00:19:29.270
Faking age and body: Body Size Attack!

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:30.710
Allow me to explain!

00:19:30.710 --> 00:19:32.990
This is a horrifying special 
attack used against

00:19:32.990 --> 00:19:35.590
women that will announce 
to everyone their

00:19:35.590 --> 00:19:37.850
measurements using a 
magical measuring tape!

00:19:37.850 --> 00:19:38.780
What?!

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:42.530
Let me measure you!

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:44.920
S-Stop it, Kanamori!

00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:46.910
I've got them!

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:47.540
Bust: 8—

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:48.520
Beep!

00:19:48.520 --> 00:19:49.340
Waist: 5—

00:19:49.340 --> 00:19:50.380
Beep!

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:55.070
She censored it by saying beep!

00:19:55.070 --> 00:19:56.180
No fair!

00:19:56.180 --> 00:19:58.860
This was supposed to 
be a great scene where

00:19:58.860 --> 00:20:01.850
the hero comes back to win everything!

00:20:00.440 --> 00:20:01.850
She's starting to get mad back.

00:20:01.850 --> 00:20:02.740
You jerk!

00:20:02.740 --> 00:20:04.660
Don't throw your tailor shears at me!

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:05.450
Shut up!

00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:08.770
This is bad. The clubroom 
is being destroyed.

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:10.730
I think they got a little too worked up.

00:20:13.300 --> 00:20:14.980
This rose...

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:19.550
Tuxe-noh mask!

00:20:26.230 --> 00:20:27.740
Who was that?!

00:20:28.210 --> 00:20:30.600
Thank you, Tuxe-noh mask!

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:33.570
We've been able to keep the 
clubroom safe and peaceful!

00:20:33.570 --> 00:20:35.500
You're the one who was just 
going crazy this whole time!

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:37.750
Anyway,

00:20:38.270 --> 00:20:41.180
it looks like we've got our 
regular Astronomy Club back,

00:20:41.180 --> 00:20:42.380
so let's have some tea.

00:20:45.820 --> 00:20:49.000
Look over there. 
That's the Evening Star.

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:50.610
Vice President,

00:20:50.610 --> 00:20:53.690
Hokule'a is the name of a star, right?

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:56.400
If I remember correctly, in Hawaiian, 
it means "star of gladness,"

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:58.620
and it's also known as Arcturus.

00:20:58.620 --> 00:20:59.610
That's right.

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:02.800
Hokule'a is the star that 
represents the spring sky,

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:06.550
and it's also well known 
in star navigation.

00:21:06.550 --> 00:21:07.480
Hm?

00:21:07.480 --> 00:21:09.730
It's an important star in the sky.

00:21:09.730 --> 00:21:11.550
Vice President, do you have a moment?

00:21:11.550 --> 00:21:12.120
Huh?

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:14.410
There's something I 
don't understand here.

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:16.580
What's wrong?

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:19.740
Why was the vice-president 
talking about Hokule'a?

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:22.570
We mustn't forget about Hokule'a.

00:21:22.770 --> 00:21:26.430
She meant Kanamori.

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:27.520
Huh?

00:21:27.520 --> 00:21:29.300
Every star has its purpose.

00:21:29.870 --> 00:21:34.150
There's a reason for Kanamori 
being in this club, as well.

00:21:35.010 --> 00:21:36.700
You're doing

00:21:37.610 --> 00:21:40.730
a lot more astronomy than 
I thought you guys were.

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:42.680
Hm? Whatcha talking about?

00:21:42.680 --> 00:21:44.070
Kanamori, go away.

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:46.380
Hey, that's mean!

00:21:46.380 --> 00:21:49.700
Kanamori, you don't 
have to hide anymore?

00:21:49.940 --> 00:21:51.870
Nope, I'm fine.

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:54.210
After messing around with 
you guys in the club,

00:21:54.210 --> 00:21:55.710
I don't really care about it anymore.

00:21:58.120 --> 00:22:02.960
Tuxe-noh Mask said, "When the 
Evening Star shines,

00:22:02.960 --> 00:22:05.670
a single light will fly 
towards the cosmos.

00:22:06.150 --> 00:22:07.800
And that will be me."

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:09.840
He never said anything like that.

00:22:09.840 --> 00:22:12.300
I am the chosen warrior,

00:22:12.300 --> 00:22:14.630
so I have to protect

00:22:14.630 --> 00:22:16.910
the Astronomy Club in his stead from now on.

00:22:19.280 --> 00:22:20.560
She ran off...

00:22:22.630 --> 00:22:25.830
I feel better knowing that 
Kanamori-san is going

00:22:25.830 --> 00:22:27.360
to protect the Astronomy Club.

00:22:27.770 --> 00:22:29.550
You've got to be kidding me.

00:22:41.580 --> 00:22:45.090
<b>How about agonizing 
in the Astronomy Club?</b>

00:22:46.870 --> 00:22:48.250
Agonizing astronomy club?

00:24:20.820 --> 00:24:23.940
Welcome to my doujin shop!

00:24:24.830 --> 00:24:26.810
Amateur copy machine doujin!

00:24:26.810 --> 00:24:29.530
I love it when the guy leads on, 
but really wants to take it.

00:24:30.650 --> 00:24:34.160
Everyone collect rare ones with me!

00:24:30.670 --> 00:24:31.650
The Forbidden Sanctuary

00:24:34.460 --> 00:24:36.910
Ebiten! Kanamori's Doujin Shop.

00:24:36.910 --> 00:24:39.130
We've got a wonderful roller bag, too.

00:24:38.350 --> 00:24:40.440
Next time: Put Love Into It, Not Konpeito
Look forward to it!
